/h1><p class=\"hero__lede\">Pay contributors in USDC while compensation amounts remain confidential within Paylore’s payroll system, with clear organization controls and contributor ownership.</p><div class=\"hero__actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/auth\">Get started</a><a class=\"button button--secondary\" href=\"/product\">Explore Paylore</a></div></div><div class=\"hero__visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-panel\"><div class=\"hero-panel__mark\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/brand/paylore.svg\"/></div><p class=\"hero-panel__title\">Clear controls. Private compensation.</p><p class=\"hero-panel__copy\">Unclaimed payroll remains under organization control. After a successful claim, compensation belongs to the contributor.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"site-container section\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Payroll without ordinary public salary balances</h2><p class=\"section-heading__copy\">Payroll should work for the people who run it without turning compensation into ordinary public token balances. Paylore combines wallet authentication, workspace controls, contributor onboarding, confidential payroll infrastructure, and organization-scoped operational records in one product.</p></div><div class=\"card-grid\"><article class=\"card\"><span class=\"card__number\">01</span><h3>Confidential compensation</h3><p>Paylore is designed to keep compensation amounts confidential while they remain within the confidential payroll system. Public blockchain activity can still reveal information outside Paylore’s control, so Paylore does not promise anonymity or untraceability.</p></article><article class=\"card\"><span class=\"card__number\">02</span><h3>Organization controls</h3><p>Workspaces define access, contributor relationships, subscription state, reserve custody, and operational boundaries. Roles clarify who administers the workspace, who has finance and audit access, and who receives compensation.</p></article><article class=\"card\"><span class=\"card__number\">03</span><h3>Contributor ownership</h3><p>Before a successful claim, the organization follows the pre-claim recovery rules. After a successful contributor claim, organization recovery authority ends for that compensation.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"site-container section\"><div class=\"surface-card\"><div class=\"surface-card__header\"><h2>USDC on Solana</h2><p>Paylore uses USDC for payroll and workspace payments, with confidential payroll infrastructure built around Solana and Token-2022.</p></div><div class=\"prose\"><h3>How it works</h3><ol class=\"numbered-list\"><li>Connect a supported wallet.</li><li>Sign in to Paylore.</li><li>Create or choose a workspace.</li><li>Activate the workspace subscription.</li><li>Add and onboard contributors.</li><li>Run payroll through the payroll workflows.</li></ol><h3>Security</h3><p>Authentication, authorization, reserve custody, provider credentials, and other privileged operations are enforced on the server. Sensitive cryptographic material is not delivered to the browser.</p></div><div class=\"hero__actions\"><a class=\"button button--secondary\" href=\"/security\">Read the Security overview</a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><nav class=\"site-container site-footer__inner\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\"><div class=\"site-footer__content\"><p class=\"site-footer__description\">Private on-chain payroll for crypto-native organizations.</p><ul class=\"site-footer__links\"><li><a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a></li><li><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></li><li><a href=\"/security\">Security</a></li></ul></div></nav></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1-n00qz7d3x4i.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[43499,[\\\"/_ne